<title>BELARUS: Belarus February PPI rose 13.5 pct vs 16.8 pct Jan.</title>
<headline>Belarus February PPI rose 13.5 pct vs 16.8 pct Jan.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Producer prices in Belarus rose by 13.5 percent in February after 16.8 percent in January, Statistics Ministry data showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    PRODUCER PRICES	   Feb 97	Jan 97	Feb 96</p>
<p>    Month/month change     +13.5 pct   +16.8 pct    +8.0 pct</p>
<p>    Year/year change	 +66.3 pct   +47.5 pct   +55.0 pct</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom +38-044-229-2264</p>
